            "displayName": "Grant Ingersoll",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "I have committed the original patch.  All tests pass.  In the end, I could not find a way I felt comfortable with for getting rid of the if-then-else clause in FieldsReader.  I did add a TODO item there to remind us to go back and take a look at it again later.\n\nSince the if clauses are ordered according to their most common usages (I think), I don't think there will be much of a performance issue w/ the current approach.",
